+The negated elastic trial, descending principal v1/v2/v3, gaps, Ftrial, gsl/gsr/gla/gra and face/left/right multipliers match Eqs4.8-4.27. The gap-based class_ga is the source apex root rewritten using Ftrial and nonnegative gaps; it is not an elastic tolerance zone. class_gs=Ftrial/ds. The apex-first classifier is exhaustive because L and R are convex combinations of gsl/gsr, the source affine q branches meet continuously and decrease strictly. Apex root>=max(L,R) owns apex equality; otherwise face root<min(gsl,gsr) owns the open face; otherwise gsl<gsr selects left and the remaining reachable case right. If gsl=gsr both edge intervals are empty. Ftrial<=0 owns elastic equality, including zero-multiplier repeated/hydrostatic states. Source Theorem4.2's strict interior presentation does not erase the explicitly closed lower apex interval on p11.
